...


Interesting that the boulder case statement is not actally reachable,
since boulders are in rock_class. (The code for throwing boulders is 
somewhere else).

The bottom line weapon damage is:
 Statues: 1-2 (no enchantment bonus)
 Clubs: 1-6 against small, 1-3 against large
 Iron balls: 1-25 (no enchantment bonus)
